{
 "v": 2,
 "src_hash": "e0a6cbbb8522d558",
 "duration": 696,
 "size": 5566632,
 "cues": [
  {
   "start": 0.6,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "欢迎回来。今天是一条政治新闻，地点在德国的邻居，捷克。"
  },
  {
   "start": 7.96,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "上周日，布拉格有几十万人上街，抗议政府改革公共电视台和电台的经费制度。"
  },
  {
   "start": 16.93,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "现在，捷克的公共电视和广播，主要靠每个家庭每月交的一笔费用来维持，大约二百多克朗。政府打算取消这笔费用，改成直接从国家预算里拨钱，而且总额还要削减大约百分之十五。"
  },
  {
   "start": 36.5,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "批评的人担心：钱由政府直接给，政府就更容易控制媒体。游行的人举着牌子，英语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 46.4,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hands off the media!"
  },
  {
   "start": 49.08,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语新闻里写的是："
  },
  {
   "start": 51.78,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Hände weg von den Medien!"
  },
  {
   "start": 56.23,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是：别碰媒体，把手拿开。"
  },
  {
   "start": 60.74,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "开始之前，先复习上一期的两个词。同意、许可。"
  },
  {
   "start": 69.76,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "consent."
  },
  {
   "start": 72.04,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Einwilligung."
  },
  {
   "start": 75.92,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "处以罚款。"
  },
  {
   "start": 80.79,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "impose a fine."
  },
  {
   "start": 83.37,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "ein Bußgeld verhängen."
  },
  {
   "start": 87.76,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "今天学五个词。我们开始。"
  },
  {
   "start": 92.63,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第一个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 94.9,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 97.37,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 99.74,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是集会、大规模的示威活动。名词动词都能用。做动词时，意思是聚集起来，表示支持或者反对。"
  },
  {
   "start": 111.62,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，英语这样说："
  },
  {
   "start": 114.72,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Hundreds of thousands of people rallied in Prague on Sunday."
  },
  {
   "start": 119.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "几十万人周日在布拉格集会。德语新闻最常用的词是："
  },
  {
   "start": 126.06,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Kundgebung."
  },
  {
   "start": 129.47,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语这一句是："
  },
  {
   "start": 131.74,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "In Prag fand am Sonntag eine riesige Kundgebung statt."
  },
  {
   "start": 137.55,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前半部分的意思是告诉大家、公开宣布。所以，德语的集会，字面上就是：大家聚在一起，公开说出自己的意见。顺便一提，德语里游行也常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 153.45,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Demo."
  },
  {
   "start": 156.5,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "生活里，这个英语词还有一个常见意思：重新振作、反弹。比如股市回升："
  },
  {
   "start": 165.49,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Stocks rallied after the news."
  },
  {
   "start": 168.53,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "消息出来后，股市反弹了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 172.32,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：一大群人从四面八方，重新聚到同一个广场上。聚起来，就是这个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 181.83,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 184.1,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "a huge rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 189.5,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "eine riesige Kundgebung."
  },
  {
   "start": 196.22,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第二个，是一个词组。"
  },
  {
   "start": 199.28,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 202.33,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 205.28,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是公共广播机构，也就是靠公共资金、不属于政府也不属于私人老板的电视台和电台。英国广播公司就是最有名的例子。"
  },
  {
   "start": 218.42,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这个词组的后半部分来自一个动词："
  },
  {
   "start": 222.56,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "broadcast."
  },
  {
   "start": 224.84,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是广播、播出。"
  },
  {
   "start": 228.04,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语里这是一个你在德国每天都会碰到的词："
  },
  {
   "start": 232.88,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "öffentlich-rechtlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 236.62,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "字面意思是：依照公法设立的。德国的公共广播就叫："
  },
  {
   "start": 243.0,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der öffentlich-rechtliche Rundfunk."
  },
  {
   "start": 248.3,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德国第一电视台和第二电视台，都属于这一类。"
  },
  {
   "start": 253.64,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里："
  },
  {
   "start": 255.82,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Critics fear the plan will weaken the independence of public broadcasters."
  },
  {
   "start": 261.58,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kritiker fürchten um die Unabhängigkeit der öffentlich-rechtlichen Sender."
  },
  {
   "start": 267.92,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "批评的人担心，公共广播会失去独立性。"
  },
  {
   "start": 273.15,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆小技巧：后半部分，原本是农民把种子往田里大把撒出去的动作，撒得又宽又广。电台把声音撒向所有人，就是广播。"
  },
  {
   "start": 286.66,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 288.93,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 294.38,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "öffentlich-rechtlich."
  },
  {
   "start": 300.72,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第三个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 303.0,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 305.68,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 308.27,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是执照费，在这里专指每家每户交给公共广播的那笔钱。英国就叫这个名字。新闻里也常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 319.47,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "broadcasting fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 322.37,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 324.54,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Rundfunkgebühr."
  },
  {
   "start": 328.29,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "你在德国交的那笔，现在的正式名称其实是："
  },
  {
   "start": 333.44,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rundfunkbeitrag."
  },
  {
   "start": 337.59,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "就是每个月寄信来让你交钱的那个。两个词的区别是：一个是按使用收的费，一个是每户都要交的分摊。"
  },
  {
   "start": 348.57,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里，捷克政府的计划是："
  },
  {
   "start": 352.38,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The government wants to scrap the licence fee and pay for public media from the state budget."
  },
  {
   "start": 359.02,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Rundfunkgebühren abschaffen und die Sender aus dem Staatshaushalt finanzieren."
  },
  {
   "start": 367.07,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "政府想取消这笔费用，改成用国家预算来养公共媒体。"
  },
  {
   "start": 373.42,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这里还有两个顺带的词。取消、废除，英语口语常说："
  },
  {
   "start": 380.1,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "scrap."
  },
  {
   "start": 382.38,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 384.55,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "abschaffen."
  },
  {
   "start": 387.57,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "国家预算，德语是："
  },
  {
   "start": 390.58,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Staatshaushalt."
  },
  {
   "start": 394.52,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：每个月信箱里那封来要钱的信。在德国它叫这个名字，在英国叫那个名字，在捷克，政府想把它取消。"
  },
  {
   "start": 407.34,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 409.61,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "the licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 414.77,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rundfunkbeitrag."
  },
  {
   "start": 421.32,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "第四个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 423.6,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 426.07,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 428.44,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "注意：做名词时，重音在前面。"
  },
  {
   "start": 432.65,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "an OVERhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 435.02,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "做动词时，重音在后面。"
  },
  {
   "start": 438.47,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "to overHAUL."
  },
  {
   "start": 440.96,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是彻底检修、全面改革。不是小修小补，而是拆开重来。"
  },
  {
   "start": 448.8,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "德语可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 450.98,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 455.08,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "前面这个词意思是从根基上，后面这个词意思是改建。也可以说："
  },
  {
   "start": 462.82,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Reform."
  },
  {
   "start": 466.01,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里："
  },
  {
   "start": 468.18,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "The plan would overhaul the way public media are funded."
  },
  {
   "start": 472.82,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Die Regierung will die Finanzierung der Medien grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 478.99,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "政府要彻底改变公共媒体的经费方式。"
  },
  {
   "start": 483.71,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "生活里，修车最常用："
  },
  {
   "start": 487.03,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "My car needs an engine overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 490.12,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "我的车需要大修发动机。"
  },
  {
   "start": 493.72,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：修车师傅把整台发动机从车上吊出来，从上到下全部拆开检查。前半部分是从头到尾，后半部分是拖、拽。整个拖出来修，就是这个词。"
  },
  {
   "start": 510.69,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 512.96,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "a complete overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 518.43,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 524.94,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "最后一个，第五个。"
  },
  {
   "start": 527.88,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "undermine."
  },
  {
   "start": 530.35,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "undermine."
  },
  {
   "start": 532.72,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "意思是削弱、暗中破坏。通常是慢慢地、从下面一点一点地破坏，而不是一下子打垮。"
  },
  {
   "start": 542.58,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "这个词最好记，因为德语几乎一模一样："
  },
  {
   "start": 547.15,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "untergraben."
  },
  {
   "start": 550.27,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "英语拆开，前半部分是下面，后半部分是挖矿、挖洞。德语拆开，前半部分也是下面，后半部分也是挖。两种语言，都是在墙脚下面挖洞。"
  },
  {
   "start": 565.5,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "新闻里："
  },
  {
   "start": 567.68,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Protesters say the plan would undermine press freedom."
  },
  {
   "start": 572.04,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "Kritiker sagen, die Reform würde die Pressefreiheit untergraben."
  },
  {
   "start": 578.67,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "抗议的人说，这个计划会削弱新闻自由。"
  },
  {
   "start": 583.49,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "生活里："
  },
  {
   "start": 585.66,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "Lack of sleep can undermine your health."
  },
  {
   "start": 588.82,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "睡眠不足会慢慢损害你的健康。"
  },
  {
   "start": 593.34,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "记忆画面：有人在一座墙的地基下面偷偷挖洞。墙表面上看起来好好的，其实已经越来越不稳了。"
  },
  {
   "start": 603.78,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "跟我读。"
  },
  {
   "start": 606.05,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "undermine."
  },
  {
   "start": 610.92,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "untergraben."
  },
  {
   "start": 616.44,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "最后，小测验。我说中文，你先在心里说出英语和德语，再听答案。"
  },
  {
   "start": 624.85,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "集会、示威。"
  },
  {
   "start": 631.08,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "a rally."
  },
  {
   "start": 633.35,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "die Kundgebung."
  },
  {
   "start": 637.16,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "公共广播机构。"
  },
  {
   "start": 643.22,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "public broadcaster."
  },
  {
   "start": 646.07,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "öffentlich-rechtlicher Rundfunk."
  },
  {
   "start": 651.3,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "广播费。"
  },
  {
   "start": 657.17,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "licence fee."
  },
  {
   "start": 659.66,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "der Rundfunkbeitrag."
  },
  {
   "start": 664.21,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "彻底改革、大修。"
  },
  {
   "start": 670.75,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "overhaul."
  },
  {
   "start": 673.02,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "grundlegend umbauen."
  },
  {
   "start": 677.53,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "削弱、暗中破坏。"
  },
  {
   "start": 684.14,
   "l": "en",
   "t": "undermine."
  },
  {
   "start": 686.42,
   "l": "de",
   "t": "untergraben."
  },
  {
   "start": 689.94,
   "l": "zh",
   "t": "全部答对了吗？今天就到这里，明天见。"
  }
